                        queue.cacheQueue, queue.networkQueue, queue.cache,
                        queue.delivery))
                .withNetworkDispatcherFactory(
                        new AndroidNetworkDispatcher.NetworkDispatcherFactory(
                                queue.networkQueue, queue.network,
                                queue.cache, queue.delivery));
        queue.start();
        return queue;
